{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/solar-exalted/988074-solar-bonus-exp-while-still-mortals","id":988074,"title":"Solar/bonus exp while still mortals.","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Exalted","Solar Exalted"],"posts":[{"date":"2016-10-15T19:58:29-07:00","id":988074,"title":"Solar/bonus exp while still mortals.","content":"So my game has the players start out as mortal. In 2nd ed the bonus exp was more a house rule to give to players if they did something extra like maybe a journal or illustrations ect. In 3rd end we have a nice built in system with solar xp, that you can't spend on solar charms. So I know it's kind of ironic, but what are your thoughts on giving Solar exp out to mortals for things like intimacy adherance? Or for things like detailing a backstory? I'm thinking my group will only be mortals for 2 stories maybe. Or since its minuscule should I just make it exp? 3rd level stunt exp are no longer a thing right?<br /> <br /> Any thoughts on the subject?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/754-eldagusto","name":"Eldagusto","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar754_2.gif","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6435"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-10-15T20:02:09-07:00","id":988075,"title":"","content":"Also I figure I'll parcel out the charms and bonus that you tack onto the players a bit slower then suggested. So over downtimes they will pick up free solar charms till they get their starting amount after maybe half a year or so.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/754-eldagusto","name":"Eldagusto","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar754_2.gif","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6435"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-10-15T21:26:48-07:00","id":988115,"title":"","content":"Based on developer comments, we know that Solar XP isn't called such &quot;because only Solars get it&quot; but because it is &quot;the highest form&quot; of XP -- and that others get it, with their own means rather than Solar Roles.<br /> <br /> As such I would say it is totally appropriate to permit your mortals an Expression Bonus for their intimacies and flaws, and a Role bonus for either ceding the scene or supporting someone else doing the thing they specialize at, or pursuing Roles that most match their focuses and abilities. So the socially-oriented mortal merchant might pick up a Role bonus for either Zenith intimacy-driven inspiration, hardship, or great deeds, or for Eclipse-style accords, diplomacy, and social maneuvering. Or if he's more mental, maybe he gets it for Night-style trickery through commerce and underhanded social dealings. Regardless,a +2 &quot;That was cool and very in style and clever&quot; for that is cool, as is &quot;That was awesome pursuit of intimacy or demonstration of flaw&quot;.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":756,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/756-meianno-yuurei","user":"Meianno Yuurei","date":". 10-16-2016, 12:32 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/756-meianno-yuurei","name":"Meianno Yuurei","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar756_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"541"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-10-16T01:31:08-07:00","id":988182,"title":"","content":"If they're only going to be mortals for 2 sessions, it doesn't really matter, tbh. So yeah, if you want to, just give them Solar XP. If you/they know what castes they're going to be, even give them their caste's role bonus, if you'd like to.<br /> <br /> The point of Solar XP is so that players don't feel they have to save all their XP for cool charms and it's a &quot;waste&quot; to spend it on anything else. For mortal characters, this isn't a big issue. If you think your players are going to want to hoard all their xp to spend on charms when they exalt, then I can see the point of giving them Solar xp.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>STing Bronze Age Exalted","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2402-the-wizard-of-oz","name":"The Wizard of Oz","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2402_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10350"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-10-17T01:26:43-07:00","id":988735,"title":"","content":"In my game, which had an indeterminably long prologue (&quot;you guys will Exalt when we're finished going over the basics of the system or whenever you do something particularly noteworthy, whichever comes later&quot;), I decided that <i>all </i>xp earned by mortals counts as solar xp (in order to incentivize spending it instead of saving it up for Charms later). They could gain expression bonuses and the role bonus for ceding the spotlight, but no other role bonus.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/823884-3e-the-artifact-and-evocation-workshop?p=943303#post943303\" target=\"_blank\">Evocations for the demonic tattoos gained from the Pact with Mara sorcerous initiation</a> || <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/823884-3e-the-artifact-and-evocation-workshop?p=907071#post907071\" target=\"_blank\">Pyre-Kindler (Soulsteel and Red Jade Grimscythe, Artifact 3)</a> || <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1072019-soulsteel-stormcaller-concept-gravedigger?p=1074897#post1074897\" target=\"_blank\">Tenebrous Descent (Stormcaller's Black Jade Reaver Daiklave cousin, Artifact 5)</a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1074256-combat-with-corebook-shikari-antagonists?p=1074303#post1074303\" target=\"_blank\">Advice for running the corebook shikari antagonists</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3443-aluminiumtrioxid","name":"aluminiumtrioxid","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3443_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"606"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-10-17T01:40:58-07:00","id":988737,"title":"","content":"That's a good idea. Otherwise I can definitely see people hoarding it, and then upon exalting suddenly learning 30 charms instead of 15.<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>STing Bronze Age Exalted","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2402-the-wizard-of-oz","name":"The Wizard of Oz","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2402_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10350"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-10-17T05:10:37-07:00","id":988798,"title":"","content":"Two stories not two sessions.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>aluminiumtrioxid</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/solar-exalted/988074-solar-bonus-exp-while-still-mortals?p=988735#post988735\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">In my game, which had an indeterminably long prologue (&amp;quot;you guys will Exalt when we're finished going over the basics of the system or whenever you do something particularly noteworthy, whichever comes later&amp;quot<img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/wink.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Wink\" smilieid=\"4\" class=\"inlineimg\" />, I decided that <i>all </i>xp earned by mortals counts as solar xp (in order to incentivize spending it instead of saving it up for Charms later). They could gain expression bonuses and the role bonus for ceding the spotlight, but no other role bonus.</div> </div> </div> </div>Oh this is brilliant!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/754-eldagusto","name":"Eldagusto","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar754_2.gif","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6435"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-10-17T06:46:26-07:00","id":988834,"title":"","content":"That also stops them from immediately having higher Essence.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>SWTOR Referal: <a href=\"http://www.swtor.com/r/JQ2nqy\" target=\"_blank\">http://www.swtor.com/r/JQ2nqy</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/414-gallus","name":"Gallus","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar414_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"886"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-10-23T23:44:26-07:00","id":992281,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>aluminiumtrioxid</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/solar-exalted/988074-solar-bonus-exp-while-still-mortals?p=988735#post988735\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">In my game, which had an indeterminably long prologue (&amp;quot;you guys will Exalt when we're finished going over the basics of the system or whenever you do something particularly noteworthy, whichever comes later&amp;quot<img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/wink.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Wink\" smilieid=\"4\" class=\"inlineimg\" />, I decided that <i>all </i>xp earned by mortals counts as solar xp (in order to incentivize spending it instead of saving it up for Charms later). They could gain expression bonuses and the role bonus for ceding the spotlight, but no other role bonus.</div> </div> </div> </div>Thus is what I did for Hakura Chronicle and it has turned out well.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i>May you live in interesting times...</i><br /> <br /> Storyteller of <b><a href=\"https://sunforgedoath.obsidianportal.com/\" target=\"_blank\">Sun Forged Oath</a></b>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1998-keichiokami","name":"Keichiokami","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1998_4.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"303"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-10-24T00:22:18-07:00","id":992295,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Meianno Yuurei</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/solar-exalted/988074-solar-bonus-exp-while-still-mortals?p=988115#post988115\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Based on developer comments, we know that Solar XP isn't called such &quot;because only Solars get it&quot; but because it is &quot;the highest form&quot; of XP -- and that others get it, with their own means rather than Solar Roles.</div> </div> </div> </div>I kind of wish they had used a different name - maybe going with the with Emerald, Sapphire and Adamant tier so you'd get Adamant XP, rather than going with Solar XP. I have run into many people who find it totally un-intuitive (and I had to remind my players on several occasions) that you can't spend your &quot;Solar experience points&quot; to purchase Solar Charms.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/741-anubisxy","name":"AnubisXy","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar741_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5693"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-10-24T03:00:38-07:00","id":992307,"title":"","content":"In the game where I had players start out as mortals and Exalt at the climax of the first story arc, I elected not to hand out Solar XP while they were still mortal, as I wanted them to feel they're not just much more powerful as Exalted, but also growing in power and gaining new tricks faster than they had as mortals.<br /> <br /> If I had a mortal character playing alongside the Exalted in a mixed game for any reason, I'd certainly not do it the same way, the guy would be fighting an uphill battle anyway without me hamstringing his exp gains.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/582-morangias","name":"Morangias","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar582_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1670"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-11-03T23:03:10-07:00","id":998102,"title":"","content":"So when gaining the bonus for learning something new about the character should it be dependent on the player explaining what was learned. Or do you think one should be lenient and award it based off of the ST noting it? It does seem to be the equivalent of the old learning curve bonus from WW games.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/754-eldagusto","name":"Eldagusto","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar754_2.gif","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6435"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}